### Sales report (10 invoice rows per page)
# Returns filtered invoice rows, five summary cards and the selected year's 12-month chart.
GET {{base_url}}/api/finance/sales-report/?date_from=2026-01-01&date_to=2026-12-31&customer=1&category=2&status=partial&year=2026&page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Sales report without filters
GET {{base_url}}/api/finance/sales-report/?year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Export the same filtered invoice rows as CSV (Excel compatible)
GET {{base_url}}/api/finance/sales-report/?date_from=2026-01-01&date_to=2026-12-31&customer=1&category=2&status=partial&export=excel
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
